@sbrugman  any ideas on how to get the start and end time for the reproduction table?

Tip to prevent code duplication. Rather than this pattern:
```
if a:
    function(a)
else:
   function(default_params)
```

You could also write

```
if not a:
   a = default_params

function(a)
```

As long as `a` is a local variable not being used later on, this will be more maintainable.
